# Local AI Overrides (gitignored)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` and fill in machine/account-specific values.
`CLAUDE.local.md` is gitignored, so secrets and infra details never get committed.
Claude Code loads it automatically alongside CLAUDE.md.

